// The zellij configuration test runs use, pointed at by ZELLIJ_CONFIG_DIR.
//
// Its existence is the point: with no config file at all zellij opens its
// first run setup wizard, which swallows the screen and every keystroke a test
// tries to send. Stock keybindings are kept, so <C-q> quits and <C-p> enters
// pane mode exactly as the documentation says.
//
// The developer's own configuration is deliberately not used: a test must not
// change its result because someone rebound a key or picked a different theme.

// The startup tip and release note panes open over the layout and would be the
// first thing every dump caught.
show_startup_tips false
show_release_notes false

theme "default"
default_mode "normal"
pane_frames true
mouse_mode false
copy_on_select false
